+    "description": "A curated read-only subset of the Google Drive API v3, shipped with the mcpx google-drive example declaration (#1936). Google publishes Drive as a discovery document rather than an OpenAPI document; this document covers only the read operations the declaration exposes: listing and reading file metadata, reading the account's storage usage, and listing shared drives.",
